## Region and native scope

`Machines.TypedBoundary` composes exact finite frontiers under local admission
and relates different boundary representations. Macro-step fusion retains the
frontier, not primitive transition counts. An optional offer declines before
work; partial execution needs its retained residual state. The ordered HE
adapter reuses `ProducerCompletion` for that purpose.

This root does not assert that every native admission predicate satisfies the
certificates. The scoped first-success adapter is built, but alignment of the
native admission and continuation lowering remains open. Full source
shown-range analysis and remaining native analyzer cases are also explicit
obligations. Zero-argument PROG1/PROGN control-plan adequacy is not supplied
by these instances. The open-frame source checker is built; correspondence with
native VarId/fact flags is not inferred. Equal open range syntax across an
activation is insufficient for call admission. A shape-cache key must retain
each observation used by inference: full inferred child types alone do not
determine raw tuple-part annotations or literal-sensitive special-head typing.
